<title>BELGIUM: Belgian Sofina to pay dividend June 25.</title>
<headline>Belgian Sofina to pay dividend June 25.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Holding company Sofina said on Thursday it would pay a net dividend of 535 francs per share on its 1996 results on June 25.</p>
<p>The company, whose profits rose to 1.63 billion francs last year from 1.47 billion in 1995, paid a net dividend of 515 francs per share on its 1995 results.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
